    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="16.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hl">Hl</ref> 16.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif hit man eft æt þam mæn in cænt ætfó, þonne tæme he to wic to cyngæs sele to þam mæn ðe him sealde, gif he þane wite ⁊ æt þam teame gebrengen mæge.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a person afterwards claim possession of it from that man in Kent, then let him [the person who bought the goods] vouch in the king’s hall in that town that man who sold it to him, if he knows him and is able to bring him to that vouching.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif hit man eft æt þam mæn in Cænt ætfó, þonne tæme he to wic to cyngæs sele to þam mæn ðe him sealde, gif he þane wite ⁊ æt þam teame gebrengen mæge.</ab>
      </div>
